```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Advanced Notepad</title>
  <style>
    body { margin:0; font-family:monospace; background:#222; color:#eee; height:100vh; display:flex; flex-direction:column;}
    header, footer { background:#333; color:#eee; padding:8px 12px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;}
    header { justify-content:space-between;}
